dates PostgreSQL itself. Only the backend and the function can reach Blob Storage; receipts reach the browser through the API. Addresses and passwords come from app settings (DB_URL, STORAGE_CONNECTION_STRING, …), never from code." vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="96" width="820" x="740" y="1000" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>